<programme start="20261112233000 +0000" stop="20261113013000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Tennessee Tech at Indiana</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Tennessee Tech Golden Eagles (2-1) play the Indiana Hoosiers (3-0) at Simon Skjodt Assembly Hall in Bloomington. Tennessee Tech defeated Western Kentucky 97-94 behind Cbo Newton, while Indiana topped Syracuse 83-80 behind Markus Burton.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261113013000 +0000" stop="20261113033000 +0000" channel="BIG Network"><title lang="en">Women&apos;s College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Northern Iowa at Iowa</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 10 Iowa Hawkeyes host the Northern Iowa Panthers at Carver-Hawkeye Arena. Iowa looks to clamp down defensively following a 91-79 loss, while Northern Iowa aim to bounce back after falling 76-54 on the road against South Dakota State.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191292_b_v12_bh.jpg"/></programme>
