<programme start="20261111223000 +0000" stop="20261112003000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Pennsylvania at Navy</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Pennsylvania Quakers visit the Navy Midshipmen for an NCAA Division I game in Maryland. Pennsylvania enters with a 112-70 loss to Illinois with forward Michael Zanoni, and Navy comes off a 66-60 victory over Delaware with guard David Burnett.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
