<programme start="20261111104700 +0000" stop="20261111114500 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Ancient Murders Unearthed</title><sub-title lang="en">Ötzi the Iceman</sub-title><desc lang="en">Homicide detective Rod Demery and Professor Turi King examine Europe&apos;s well-known ancient murder victim, who was frozen where he was killed over 5,000 years ago; the team learns how pollen in his gut can suggest his likely route before he died.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">History</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p24517193_b_v12_ai.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111114500 +0000" stop="20261111124300 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Secrets to Civilization</title><sub-title lang="en">Bronze Age Catastrophe</sub-title><desc lang="en">In the last decade, the search for data about the planet&apos;s environmental history has raised questions about how climate change has influenced human civilizations in the past.</desc><credits><actor>Jimmy</actor></credits><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20673555_b_v8_as.jpg"/></programme>
