<programme start="20261111110000 +0000" stop="20261111120000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Last Days of the Battleship</sub-title><desc lang="en">The USS Arizona and the HMS Hood were two of the most powerful warships in history, but their weaknesses paid a fatal price; experts investigate evidence that may reveal why the age of the battleship has come to a sudden and violent end.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111120000 +0000" stop="20261111130000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Assassins of the Deep</sub-title><desc lang="en">The wreckages of three German U-boats are eroding at the bottom of the sea along with the stories behind their disastrous fate; now, a team of maritime archaeologists race to locate the submarines and solve the mystery behind their deadly demise.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111130000 +0000" stop="20261111140000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Danger Ahead</sub-title><desc lang="en">The enigmatic shipwrecks of El Faro and the Empress of Ireland occurred a century apart and both remain a mystery of the sea; armed with the latest technology, experts explore these doomed ships to discover what set them on the path to catastrophe.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111140000 +0000" stop="20261111150000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Fail Invasions</sub-title><desc lang="en">Countless shipwrecks lost in the depths of the oceans are time capsules containing tales of adventure and tragedy; now, marine experts hunt to locate these forgotten ships, explore their secrets and unlock their incredible stories.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111150000 +0000" stop="20261111160000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Collision Course</sub-title><desc lang="en">Three historical collisions expose the volatile risks at sea and how they have shaped the technological advancements of today; now, maritime researchers explore the remnants of these shipwrecks to uncover what happened in their fatal, final moments.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111160000 +0000" stop="20261111170000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Lost Fleet of WWI</sub-title><desc lang="en">More than 50 massive warships were lost in a matter of hours in the Scottish natural harbor of Scapa Flow during World War I; now, marine archaeologists use cutting-edge technology to explore one of the greatest acts of defiance in wartime history.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261111170000 +0000" stop="20261111180000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Abandoned: Expedition Shipwreck</title><sub-title lang="en">Nuclear Wrecks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The remains of five warships could reveal new insights into how the nuclear arms race changed the world forever; using 3-D sonar scan technology, an expert team of marine scientists investigate the catastrophic effects of atomic explosions at sea.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20350629_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
